#8940 I PM counters
## The counter M55308C1005 (PRB available for PDSCH with L1 Basebnad pooling activated) value
##
## Tdlte 0ms frame struct, with the trs tracking period =80ms, 6 beams, beamRefinement true, ss burst period=20ms, bw=100Mhz (full DL PRB=273)
##   - 12 SSB slots   :  273-64=209 PRB for PDSCH
##   - 12 SIB  slots   :    273 PRB 
##   - 2 TRS   slots    :   273 PRB,  1 muted pdsch with 8940 activated if not zab cell
##   - 16 specific slots :  0 pdsch transmission
##   - 86 full DL slots  :   counted for this counter, 9 muted pdsch with 8940 activated if not zab cell;
##   - 32 RACH+UL slots : 0 pdsch
##
## Cell 1 : zab cell, BBRM allocats 273 PRB due to inter subpool pooling
##               in every 160slots : 12*209+12*273+(2-1)*273+(86-9)*273+10*273=29 808
##               in 5 mins :  29808*(600000/160)=111780000        
##               
## Cell 2 : non zab cell, BBRM allocates 54 PRB due to inter subpool pooling
##               in every 160slots : 12*(54-48)+12*54+(2-1)*54+(86-9)*54=4 932 
##               in 5mins ;   4932*(600000/160)=18495000
##
## Cell 3 : non zab cell, BBRM allocates 273 PRB due to inter sub                       
##               in every 160slots :  12*209+12*273+(2-1)*273+(86-9)*273=27 078 
##               in 5mins :   27078*(600000/160)=101542500
##               
##
## The counter M55308C00001 (DL_DATA_SLOTS) value
##
## Tdlte 0ms frame struct, with the trs tracking period =80ms, 6 beams, ss burst period=20ms, we have : 
##   - 12 SSB slots   :   not counted for this counter
##   - 12 SIB  slots   :    counted for this counter
##   - 2 TRS   slots    :   not counted for this counter,  1 muted pdsch with 8940 activated
##   - 16 specific slots :  0 pdsch transmission
##   - 86 full DL slots  :   counted for this counter, 9 muted pdsch with 8940 activated if not zab cell;
##   - 32 RACH+UL slots : 0 pdsch
##
## Cell 1 : zab cell :  expected value of M55308C00001 = (86+12)*(600000/160)=367500
## Cell 2 & Cell 3 :  non zab cell :  expected value of M55308C00001 = (86+12-9)*(600000/160)=333750

&{8940_I_BB_POOL_Counter_Expected}      PM_ID=M55308C10005
...                                     CELL_1_Expected=111780000
...                                     CELL_2_Expected=18495000
...                                     CELL_3_Expected=101542500

&{8940_I_DL_Slots_Counter_Expected}     PM_ID=M55308C00001
...                                     CELL_1_Expected=367500
...                                     CELL_2_Expected=333750
...                                     CELL_3_Expected=333750

&{8940_I_DL_Grant_BWP0_Counter_Expected}     PM_ID=M55335C02004
...                                     CELL_1_Expected=420000
...                                     CELL_2_Expected=341250
...                                     CELL_3_Expected=382500

&{8940_I_DL_Grant_BWP1_Counter_Expected}     PM_ID=M55335C05004
...                                     CELL_1_Expected=420000
...                                     CELL_2_Expected=382500
...                                     CELL_3_Expected=382500

#8940 J PM counters 
## The counter M55308C1005 (PRB available for PDSCH with L1 Basebnad pooling activated) value
##
## Semi Static frame struct, with the trs tracking period =80ms, 6 beams, beamRefinement true, ss burst period=20ms, bw=100Mhz (full DL PRB=273)
##   - 12 SSB slots   :     273-64=209 PRB for PDSCH  // or 54-20-28=6 PRB for PDSCH
##   - 12 SIB  slots   :    273 PRB 
##   - 2 TRS   slots    :   273 PRB, 1 muted if 8940 activated but not zab cell
##   - 30 specific slots :  273 PRB
##   - 72 full DL slots  :   counted for this counter, 9 muted if 8940 activated but not zab cell
## If zab cell :  in total 128 
##
## Cell 1 : zab cell, BBRM allocats 273 PRB due to inter subpool pooling
##               in every 160slots : 12*209+12*273+2*273+30*273+72*273=34176
##               in 5 mins :  34176*(600000/160)=128160000      
##               
## Cell 2 : non zab cell, BBRM allocates 54 PRB due to inter subpool pooling
##               in every 160slots : 10 muted slots,  12*(54-48)+12*54+2*54+30*54+72*54-10*54=5796
##               in 5mins ;   5796*(600000/160)=21735000
##
## Cell 3 : non zab cell, BBRM allocates 273 PRB due to inter sub,                    
##               in every 160slots :  12*209+12*273+2*273+30*273+72*273=34176 
##                                    10 muted slots ==> 34176-10*273=31446
##               in 5mins :   31446*(600000/160)=117922500
##               
##
## The counter M55308C00001 (DL_DATA_SLOTS) value
##
## Tdlte 0ms frame struct, with the trs tracking period =80ms, 6 beams, ss burst period=20ms, we have : 
##   - 12 SSB slots   :   not counted for this counter
##   - 12 SIB  slots   :    counted for this counter
##   - 2 TRS   slots    :   not counted for this counter, 1 muted, if not zab
##   - 30 specific slots :  
##   - 72 full DL slots  :   counted for this counter, 9 muted if not zab
##  ZAB cell :  114 DL slots, non ZAB cell :  105 DL slots
##
## Cell 1 : zab cell :  expected value of M55308C00001 = (114)*(600000/160)=427500
## Cell 2 & Cell 3 :  non zab cell :  expected value of M55308C00001 = (105)*(600000/160)=397500
&{8940_J_BB_POOL_Counter_Expected}      PM_ID=M55308C10005
...                                     CELL_1_Expected=128160000
...                                     CELL_2_Expected=21735000
...                                     CELL_3_Expected=117922500

&{8940_J_DL_Slots_Counter_Expected}     PM_ID=M55308C00001
...                                     CELL_1_Expected=427500
...                                     CELL_2_Expected=393750
...                                     CELL_3_Expected=393750

# maximum of PRB that can be distributed in one subpool

*** Keywords ***

TC 8940 I With ZAB And 8940 G Activated
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     8940-I & G activated
    ...     Actions:        Cell setup & call setup with 3 UEs (UE 1 1200mbps, UE 2 10mbps, UE 3 175mbps)
    ...     Checks:         Zab privilege check : Cell 1 zab privileged=1, Cell 2 & 3 zab privileged=0;
    ...                     PM counters check : value as expected
    ...     Verdict:        Zab privilege check & PM counters value check as expected        
    [Arguments]             ${param}
    ...                     ${vendor_custom}    
    
    
    Init Sequence           ${param}
    Step                    Set RAD Params Of 8940-I
    Step                    Deploy Vendor File Config               vendor_param=${vendor_custom}        is_perform_full_commissioning=${false}
    Dated Log New Line      ${vendor_custom}
    Critical Step           Perform Recommissionning
    Critical Step           Restart TL
    Step                    Multi Cells Setup 8940 I                argument=${param.nbCell}
    Step                    SA Call DL Traffic With UE Profile      argument=${Profile_UE_1}
    Step                    sleep    2s
    Step                    SA Call DL Traffic With UE Profile      argument=${Profile_UE_2}
    Step                    sleep    2s
    Step                    SA Call DL Traffic With UE Profile      argument=${Profile_UE_3}
    Step                    sleep    2s
    Step                    Activate Sherpa On All Cells
    Step                    sleep    10s
    Step                    Stop Sherpa Collection
    Step                    Verify ZAB Privilege cells
    Step                    sleep    600s
    Step                    Collect Lastest PM Counters File
    Step                    Check 8940 I PM Counters

