Suite Setup CB008940-I
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     it needs no conditions
    ...     Actions:        it performs the generic suite setup and backup the configurations files
    ...     Checks:         it checks nothing more than already done on lib.
    ...     Verdict:        suite setup is passed
    [Arguments]             ${scfPath}=${EMPTY}
    ...                     ${basiccfgPath}=${EMPTY}
    
    Setup.Suite Setup From Scratch    keepAllUeDataInCfgFile=${True}        automaticTeardown=${True}
    ...                     scfcPathname=${scfPath}     basicPathname=${basiccfgPath}
    Backup Files
    ${scf_suite_setup_backup}         OAM Get SCF File    file=SCF_Suite_Setup_Backup.xml
    Set Suite Variable      ${scf_suite_setup_backup}
    Dated Log               SCF backup file = ${scf_suite_setup_backup}

Perform Recommissionning
    Oam.OAM Perform Full Commissioning  scf_file=${SCF_SETUP_PATH} 
    WA Airscale Wait for Ready    ${GNB_DU} 
    # Restart.F1 Wait Link Classical  

Set RAD Params Of 8940-I
    [Documentation]     Add or Modify the RAD params of 8940 To Activate the feature
    ...                 will be replaced later by NIDD params
    ...                 0x580117=1 : #CSI-RS Event Sherpa    
    ...                 0x420068=3 : rdFeatureFlagBitmap1 : 
    ...                 bit 2 -> CB007113 : 0  (disabled)
    ...                 bit 1 -> CB008847 : 1 (enabled)
    ...                 bit 0 -> CB008940 : 1 (enabled)    
    ...                 0x580690=1 : rdAllowZeroAllocByPass - 0 : ZAB Disabled - 1 : Enabled
    ...                 0x58066a=1 : InterL1SubPool         - 0 : Disabled - 1 : Enabled
    Dated Log New Line   Add RAD params of 8940-F InterL1SubPool and ZeroAllocationByPass are Disabled ......
    ${rad_param_1}=      create dictionary       field=0x580117    value=1
    ${rad_param_2}=      create dictionary       field=0x420068    value=3
    ${rad_param_3}=      create dictionary       field=0x4B000F    value=1
    # ${rad_param_4}=      create dictionary       field=0x58066a    value=1
    ${rad_param_list}=       Create List         ${rad_param_1}
    ...                                          ${rad_param_2}
    ...                                          ${rad_param_3}
    # ...                                          ${rad_param_4}
    Dated Log New Line    RAD params :  ${rad_param_list}
    SetConfig.Set Fields in swconfig DU       param_list=${rad_param_list}
    Dated Log New Line   RAD params of 8940-I update completed


Multi Cells Setup 8940 I
    [Arguments]       ${nbCell}
    ${msgStr}=    Catenate  Test ${nbCell} Cells Setup
    Dated Log   ${msgStr}
    Setup Wtsemu SA
    sleep    60s
    WTS Set X2 Link
    sleep    5s
    wtsemu.ue_testmode_decode_muxphychan    decode_mux_phy_chan=decode_PDSCH
    sleep    2s


SA Call DL Traffic With UE Profile
    [Arguments]                      ${ue_profile}
    [Documentation]                  1  UE SA call  based on UE profile (ue_id, pdu, gw, dl_tput, ul_tput, deviation)
    ...                              This keyword can be used to perform a UE call based on the UE profile
    ...                              how to use :
    ...                              - create a dictionary of ue profile with the following structure:
    ...                                 &{Profile_UE}                 
    ...                                     ue_id=1     
    ...                                     pdu=1       
    ...                                     gw=1
    ...                                     dl_tput=175   #(tput in mbps)
    ...                                     deviation=40  #(percentage of expected deviation of tput)
    ...                              - call the keyword with the UE profile 
    ...                                     SA Call DL Traffic With UE Profile     ${Profile_UE}
    CallSetup.UE Register            ue=${ue_profile.ue_id}
    sleep                            1s
    CallSetup.Launch PDU Session     ue=${ue_profile.ue_id}     pdu=${ue_profile.pdu}       gw=${ue_profile.gw}
    sleep                            1s
    ${ueSetting}                     set variable            ${BASIC_UE_SA}
    ${ueSetting.pdu}                 set variable            ${ue_profile.ue_id}
    ${ueSetting.ue}                  set variable            ${ue_profile.ue_id}
    Traffic UE DL                    ueSetting=${BASIC_UE_SA}    throughput=${ue_profile.dl_tput}    
    ...                              shouldBeStop=False          deviation=${ue_profile.deviation}
    ...                              shouldBeCheck=False   


Extract Panda Csv Based On Filter
    [Documentation]                 Extract CSV file based on filters
    [Arguments]                     ${filter_dict}
    Dated Log                       Loading csv file : ${filter_dict.sherpa_csv_file_name}
    PandasCsv.Setup Reader          ${filter_dict.sherpa_csv_file_name}
    PandasCsv.extract_cvs_files_forcolumn       filter_column=${filter_dict.filter_column_name}
    ...                                         by_value=${filter_dict.filter_by_value}
    ...                                         filter=${filter_dict.filter}
    ...                                         list_grp=None
    ...                                         csv_sep=${filter_dict.separator}


Check Zab Privileged Cell In Sherpa Pooling Report
    [Documentation]         To check the zab previleged cell 
    [Arguments]             ${sherpa_pooling_msgId} 
    ...                     ${extracted_csv_filename} 
    ...                     ${expected_zab_value}
    ...                     ${cell_id_to_check}  
    Dated Log        SherpaPoolingReport msgId : ${sherpa_pooling_msgId}
    &{dict_csv_filter}      Create Dictionary
    ...                     sherpa_csv_file_name=${sherpa_output_path}/tcpdump/${l1l2_csv_file_name} 
    ...                     filter_column_name=TEXT
    ...                     filter_by_value=MSGID
    ...                     filter=${sherpa_pooling_msgId}
    ...                     sherpa_event_id=45
    ...                     separator=;

    CB008940-I-J-Keywords.Extract Panda Csv Based On Filter       ${dict_csv_filter} 
    Dated Log       extracted csv file name : ${extracted_csv_filename}
    Dated Log       expected ZAB value : ${expected_zab_value}
    Dated Log       NrCellId : ${cell_id_to_check}
    ${found} =      Sherpa.Verify Value List In csv File Column  CsvName=${extracted_csv_filename}  
    ...                                          Column_name=ZAB Privilege
    ...                                          value_list=${expected_zab_value}
    ...                                          prereq_column=NRCellid
    ...                                          prereq_column_val=${cell_id_to_check}
    Dated Log       NrCellId : ${cell_id_to_check} ZAB Privilege= ${expected_zab_value} : ${found}
    Should Be True      ${found}


